        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 29d46e35-b20e-489e-ac55-d73443acd214).Image",
        "Description": "Fishy Joe has employed several kronstadt workers to ensure he gets first-dibs on the VIP tickets. Our client wants his little scalping ring nipped in the bud.\r-Make sure Joe sleeps with the fishes.\r-Gabriel works security. Make sure his lunch isn&apos;t so secure before he bites it.\r-Dwain Neil should have checked his periphery more often.\r-Michael Mercer deserves no mercy. She gives awful tours, so give her an in-depth tour of the chipper.",
